# This file is applied to the upload of EVERY Vercel project built from this
# repository, and it is applied immediately after the clone — before any Root
# Directory setting is resolved. Both the Go API project and the web app project
# deploy from here, so anything listed here is gone for both of them.
#
# That is why web/ is NOT listed. Excluding it deleted the Next.js app during the
# web project's own build, which then failed with "No Next.js version detected":
# the app it was meant to build had already been removed from the upload.
# Carrying the app in the API project's upload costs a little transfer and
# nothing else — the Go builder ignores it.
#
# The dataset under data/ is embedded into the Go function and MUST ship.
# Everything below is irrelevant to both builds, so skip uploading it.
docs/
proto/
.sources/
config/
coverage.out
